id: ANS-022
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 4
action: advisory
title: Disabled fact gathering
category: quality
severity: info
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .yaml .yml
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ .git/ vendor/ node_modules/
  content_contains: gather_facts
patterns:
  - regex: gather_facts:\s*(false|no)
    message: "Facts disabled — ensure play doesn't need ansible_hostname, ansible_os_family, etc."
fix: Only disable gather_facts when the play genuinely doesn't use any facts. Add a comment explaining why facts are disabled.
